        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9la9dr-5gsd40eg",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Have breakfast at the hotel, then transfer to the bus station. Travel to Cusco with the group on a dedicated tourist coach, with stops along the way and lunch in Sicuani. In the evening, arrive at the Cusco bus station and transfer to your hotel."
